{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 3490,
    "dDurationMs": 9550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "On October the fourth, 1957 the first satellite,\nSputnik I, was launched into space."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 13040,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Although it burned up in the atmosphere three\nmonths later, many satellites launched since"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 16940,
    "dDurationMs": 4169,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then have not, leaving us with a virtual junk\nyard orbiting the earth."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 21109,
    "dDurationMs": 6180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now those debris represent a real threat to\nthe television communications and GPS satellites,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 27289,
    "dDurationMs": 1431,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "not to mention the astronauts."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 28720,
    "dDurationMs": 3580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But luckily, the Swiss have a plan to clean\nup space."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 32300,
    "dDurationMs": 4330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I have come to Lausanne to figure out how\nthey are going to do it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 36630,
    "dDurationMs": 4060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Most of the space junk orbiting earth is within\n2000 kilometers of the earth’s surface."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 40690,
    "dDurationMs": 7610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There are over 22,000 objects larger than\nthis softball and over half a million larger"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 48300,
    "dDurationMs": 1280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "than this marble."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 49580,
    "dDurationMs": 4701,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now all of the orbiting debris is going about\nseven to eight kilometers per second, but"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 54281,
    "dDurationMs": 3889,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "since the objects are moving relative to one\nanother the average speed of a collision is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 58170,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "about 10 kilometers per second."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 60000,
    "dDurationMs": 5320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And an object this size going 10 kilometers\nper second has about the same impact as a"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 65320,
    "dDurationMs": 3719,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "midsize car going nearly 200 kilometers per\nhour."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 69039,
    "dDurationMs": 4561,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is enough force to destroy any satellite\nin orbit."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 73600,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "As a veteran of four space flights, Swiss\nastronaut Claude Nicollier knows the dangers"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 78000,
    "dDurationMs": 1670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "first hand."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 79670,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Only the large debris are tracked."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 82670,
    "dDurationMs": 6699,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "By radar we know the orbit exactly and sometimes\nwe have to be a small change in the orbiter"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 89369,
    "dDurationMs": 2941,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "characteristics that our space ship, the space\nshuttle..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 92310,
    "dDurationMs": 3320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Space shuttle Endeavor...\n\u003e\u003e... because it is foreseen that next day"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 95630,
    "dDurationMs": 8430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or two days later we are going to have a close\napproach with a debris, such that NASA was"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 104060,
    "dDurationMs": 5019,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "not feeling to good about that and we translated\nour orbits so to make that distance a little"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 109079,
    "dDurationMs": 1070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "bit larger."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 110149,
    "dDurationMs": 4390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Fortunately, to date, there haven’t been\nany serious collisions with manned spaced"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 114539,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "craft."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 115539,
    "dDurationMs": 6850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But in 2009 a single crash between two satellites\nadded a whopping 2000 new pieces of debris."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 122389,
    "dDurationMs": 6331,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e If we don’t do anything, space will become\nsoon inaccessible because of the large amount"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 128720,
    "dDurationMs": 3230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of debris and the high risk of collision."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 131950,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e So the Swiss, determined to do something\nabout that problem, are extending their clean"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 135790,
    "dDurationMs": 3070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "country reputation into outer space."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 138860,
    "dDurationMs": 5890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e The Swiss space center has launched a program\ncalled Clean Space One that is a demonstrator"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 144750,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of the capability to remove debris."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 147570,
    "dDurationMs": 6570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the idea is to go and to remove one of\ntwo satellites from Switzerland."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 154140,
    "dDurationMs": 3580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e One of these two satellites is appropriately\nnamed Swiss Cube."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 157720,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Swiss Cube is a small satellite which you\nsee."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 161140,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is a one to one model."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 163570,
    "dDurationMs": 3450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So this is in the right scale."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 167020,
    "dDurationMs": 1420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It belongs to Switzerland."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 168440,
    "dDurationMs": 1720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So we had to do something about this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 170160,
    "dDurationMs": 2440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e You can’t have Swiss junk just floating\naround in space."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 172600,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e No."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 173600,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 174600,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is not acceptable."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 176340,
    "dDurationMs": 4490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e So the mission for Clean Space One is a\nproof of concept that a janitor satellite"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 180830,
    "dDurationMs": 4480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "can be sent into space to grab a piece of\nspace junk—in this case Swiss Cube and bring"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 185310,
    "dDurationMs": 4380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it back into the atmosphere where it will\nburn up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 189690,
    "dDurationMs": 5900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "To rendezvous with the space junk, the small\njanitor needs an incredibly efficient engine."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 195590,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Working on the challenge is Professor Herbert\nShea, an expert in micro mechanics."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 201590,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e This is your propulsion system."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 202590,
    "dDurationMs": 1340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e This is our propulsion system."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 203930,
    "dDurationMs": 2690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Little silicone micro machine chips."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 206620,
    "dDurationMs": 5530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We use something called electro propulsion,\nwhich allows you to emit single atoms with"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 212150,
    "dDurationMs": 3310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a ... that are electrically charged and use\nan electric field to accelerate them out."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 215460,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So you are not burning them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 216460,
    "dDurationMs": 1030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You are emitting your propellant."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 217490,
    "dDurationMs": 5610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that is what many small satellites use,\nbut nothing has been, to date, been able to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 223100,
    "dDurationMs": 1520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "make something this small."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 224620,
    "dDurationMs": 5060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So we do zero to 60 miles an hour in a about\nthree days."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 229680,
    "dDurationMs": 4970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But laughable as it, indeed, seems to all\nof us, because there is no friction in space,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 234650,
    "dDurationMs": 5080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or negligible friction, then if we wait six\nmonths, we have a huge change in speed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 239730,
    "dDurationMs": 4020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that is how the mission will be done."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 243750,
    "dDurationMs": 4210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Once propelled into the correct orbit,\nthe next challenge is to grab the space junk,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 247960,
    "dDurationMs": 4699,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "an object tumbling around uncontrollably without\ncreating more debris."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 252659,
    "dDurationMs": 1691,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Our idea is to use a very compliant system."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 254350,
    "dDurationMs": 1360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Kind of think of an octopus arm."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 255710,
    "dDurationMs": 4029,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "An octopus arm is very soft, but it can grab\nany strange shape and wrap around it and hold"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 259739,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 260739,
    "dDurationMs": 3010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And we will have a grabber that looks, in\na very ... but that real one will be more"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 263749,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "sophisticated."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 264749,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But it looks like this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 265749,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it is basically very, very soft elastomer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 266749,
    "dDurationMs": 1540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I will turn it on in a minute."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 268289,
    "dDurationMs": 1750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can see how soft it is."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 270039,
    "dDurationMs": 2861,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the idea is this will be rolled up so\nit doesn't take up much room."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 272900,
    "dDurationMs": 2380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You get into... and it will have 10 of these\nin a series."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 275280,
    "dDurationMs": 2050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You get into space, you unroll it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 277330,
    "dDurationMs": 2380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then these things can open when you turn\nthe voltage on."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 279710,
    "dDurationMs": 3479,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You are able to open this and you turn the\nvoltage off and it wraps it around and it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 283189,
    "dDurationMs": 1941,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "holds the satellite."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 285130,
    "dDurationMs": 3520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Is this going to be a little bit like those\ngames where you are trying to pick up a stuffed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 288650,
    "dDurationMs": 2979,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "toy in the arcade and drop it somewhere?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 291629,
    "dDurationMs": 2251,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Is it going to be like that?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 293880,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Essentially, yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 294880,
    "dDurationMs": 3539,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Because those games... those games can\nbe incredibly frustrating with those little"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 298419,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "arms."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 299419,
    "dDurationMs": 1401,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e They are built to be frustrating."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 300820,
    "dDurationMs": 1219,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Whereas this, this is built to be ..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 302039,
    "dDurationMs": 2491,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e This is built to succeed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 304530,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Can I ask?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 306240,
    "dDurationMs": 5740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Has anyone ever successfully gone up and grabbed\na piece of space junk and gotten rid of it?\u003e\u003e"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 311980,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "To my knowledge, no."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 312980,
    "dDurationMs": 2020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It has never been done before."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 315000,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e And it grabs on."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 317610,
    "dDurationMs": 3940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Ambitious as it may sound, the Swiss know\nhow vast this junk yard is."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 321550,
    "dDurationMs": 2170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So their ultimate aims are more modest."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 323720,
    "dDurationMs": 5919,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Hopefully starting in, say, 2020 to do\nsystematic removal of the large debris at"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 329639,
    "dDurationMs": 6541,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the rate of five or more per year in order\nto contain the increase of the debris density"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 336180,
    "dDurationMs": 1579,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in lower earth orbit."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 337759,
    "dDurationMs": 2571,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then space will continue becoming accessible."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 340330,
    "dDurationMs": 16839,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Of course, the exposure to the space environment"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 357169,
    "dDurationMs": 9941,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is a wonderful thing."
    } ]
  } ]
}
